%SIXMD 1
# @?PS - LIST PROCESSES

## DESCRIPTION

PS PRINTS PID, PARENT PID, PROCESS STATE, RESIDENT PROCESS WORDS, AND COMMAND
NAME FOR THE CURRENT PROCESS TABLE.
USAGE IS 'PS'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
